<Shell title="Become a Lotmates ambassador" description="Share the deals your neighbours want, propose new ones, and earn 10% of Lotmates' commission on every completed job in your community. Apply to join.">
  <h1>Become a Lotmates ambassador</h1>
  <p>Share the deals your neighbours want, propose new ones, and earn 10% of Lotmates' commission on every completed job in your community. You don't earn commission on your own bookings.</p>
  <h2>Who it's for</h2>
  <p>People who run their building or street group chat, sit on a residents' association, manage an estate, or are the neighbour people ask first.</p>
  <h2>How joining works</h2>
  <ol>
    <li>Apply on this page.</li>
    <li>We get in touch to learn about your community.</li>
    <li>Once approved, we email you a link to set up your ambassador account.</li>
    <li>Add your ID and bank details for payouts.</li>
    <li>Share your first deal.</li>
  </ol>
  <p>Read the <a href="/legal/ambassadors">ambassador terms</a>.</p>
</Shell>
